"https://www.ohhowcivilized.com/#/schema/person/97d9fcb3e5c452cddfaf1e981b1205fd","name":"Jee Choe","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https://www.ohhowcivilized.com/#/schema/person/image/","url":"https://www.ohhowcivilized.com/wp-content/uploads/profile-pic-96x96.jpg","contentUrl":"https://www.ohhowcivilized.com/wp-content/uploads/profile-pic-96x96.jpg","caption":"Jee Choe"},"description":"Welcome! I'm a certified Tea Sommelier and a self-proclaimed bubble tea and iced tea master. I'm all about making tea EASY and DELICIOUS.","sameAs":["https://www.ohhowcivilized.com/about/"]},{"@type":"Recipe","name":"Homemade Bubble Tea","author":{"@id":"https://www.ohhowcivilized.com/#/schema/person/97d9fcb3e5c452cddfaf1e981b1205fd"},"description":"See how easy this classic bubble tea is to make and customize.","datePublished":"2025-04-16T23:05:37+00:00","image":["https://www.ohhowcivilized.com/wp-content/uploads/bubble-tea-boba-recipe.jpg","https://www.ohhowcivilized.com/wp-content/uploads/bubble-tea-boba-recipe-500x500.jpg","https://www.ohhowcivilized.com/wp-content/uploads/bubble-tea-boba-recipe-500x375.jpg","https://www.ohhowcivilized.com/wp-content/uploads/bubble-tea-boba-recipe-480x270.jpg"],"recipeYield":["1","1 serving (16 ounces)"],"prepTime":"PT5M","cookTime":"PT10M","totalTime":"PT15M","recipeIngredient":["1 tablespoon black tea ((or 2 tea bags))","1 cup water","1 tablespoon brown sugar","¼ cup milk","¾ cup water","¼ cup tapioca balls","2 tablespoons brown sugar"],"recipeInstructions":[{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Make tea. Steep tea in hot water for 5 minutes.Set the water temperature to 195°F if you&#39;re using an electric kettle with a temperature setting. Use filtered water when possible.","name":"Make tea. Steep tea in hot water for 5 minutes.Set the water temperature to 195°F if you&#39;re using an electric kettle with a temperature setting. Use filtered water when possible.","url":"https://www.ohhowcivilized.com/how-to-make-bubble-tea/#wprm-recipe-27236-step-0-0"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Strain tea leaves. Stir in brown sugar. Set aside to cool.","name":"Strain tea leaves. Stir in brown sugar. Set aside to cool.","url":"https://www.ohhowcivilized.com/how-to-make-bubble-tea/#wprm-recipe-27236-step-0-1"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Cook tapioca balls. Boil ¾ cup of water and sugar in a saucepan. Add tapioca balls.Combine brown sugar and ¾ cup of water in a saucepan and bring it to a boil. When you see big bubbles (2-4 minutes), add tapioca balls. Keep boiling for 8 more minutes on medium-high heat. Cool slightly, until tapioca balls aren&#39;t too hot to eat. They should still be quite warm.","name":"Cook tapioca balls. Boil ¾ cup of water and sugar in a saucepan. Add tapioca balls.Combine brown sugar and ¾ cup of water in a saucepan and bring it to a boil. When you see big bubbles (2-4 minutes), add tapioca balls. Keep boiling for 8 more minutes on medium-high heat. Cool slightly, until tapioca balls aren&#39;t too hot to eat. They should still be quite warm.","url":"https://www.ohhowcivilized.com/how-to-make-bubble-tea/#wprm-recipe-27236-step-0-2"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Assemble the drink. Add warm tapioca balls in brown sugar syrup into a cup. Add ice, tea, and milk.Serve immediately and stir before drinking. Use an extra wide straw to drink.","name":"Assemble the drink. Add warm tapioca balls in brown sugar syrup into a cup. Add ice, tea, and milk.Serve immediately and stir before drinking. Use an extra wide straw to drink.","url":"https://www.ohhowcivilized.com/how-to-make-bubble-tea/#wprm-recipe-27236-step-0-3"}],"aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","ratingValue":"4.5","ratingCount":"4"},"recipeCategory":["Drinks"],"recipeCuisine":["American","Taiwanese"],"nutrition":{"@type":"NutritionInformation","calories":"310 kcal","carbohydrateContent":"72 g","proteinContent":"2 g","fatContent":"2 g","saturatedFatContent":"1 g","cholesterolContent":"7 mg","sodiumContent":"55 mg","fiberContent":"1 g","sugarContent":"39 g","unsaturatedFatContent":"2 g","servingSize":"1 serving"},"@id":"https://www.ohhowcivilized.com/how-to-make-bubble-tea/#recipe","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://www.ohhowcivilized.com/how-to-make-bubble-tea/#article"},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.ohhowcivilized.com/how-to-make-bubble-tea/"}]}</script>
