		<h2 class="wprm-recipe-name wprm-block-text-none" id="homemade-bubble-tea">Homemade Bubble Tea</h2>
		<div class="wprm-recipe-block-container wprm-recipe-block-container-separate wprm-block-text-normal wprm-recipe-author-container" style=""><span class="wprm-recipe-details-label wprm-block-text-normal wprm-recipe-author-label">By: </span><span class="wprm-recipe-details wprm-recipe-author wprm-block-text-normal">Jee Choe</span></div>
		<div class="wprm-recipe-summary wprm-block-text-normal"><span style="display: block;">See how easy this classic bubble tea is to make and customize.</span></div>
